{"strongs": "H7919", "word": "שָׂכַל", "translit": "sa.khal", "root": "שכה", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be prudent", "definition": "I. שָׂכַל verb be prudent ( Gerber 47 denominative from שֶׂכֶל , but verb early; Late Hebrew סָכַל , Hithpa`el shew oneself attentive (to), look ; Aramaic סְכַל (rare) understand , Ithpa`al look (at), consider , Aph`el instruct ; שְׂכַל only Aph`el (for Hebrew הִשְׂכִּיל ), understand, make wise ; Pa`el teach , Ethpa`al understand , etc.; Samaritan Ithpa`al look (for Hebrew הִבִּיט ); Assyrian šiklu , clever , šklûtu , cleverness , Meissn Suppl.93 ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ שׂ 1Sam 18:30 be prudent, circumspect ( SS HPS ); Kit Buhl Gerber and others prosper. Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine singular הִשְׂכִּיל Jer 23:5 ; 1Chr 28:19 1 singular הִשְׂכַּלְתִּי Ps 119:99 3 masculine plural הִשְׂכִּילוּ Job 34:27 +; Imperfect יַשְׂכִּיל 1Sam 18:5 +; 2 masculine singular jussive תַּשְׂכַּל Dan 9:25 , etc.; Imperative masculine plural הַשְׂכִּילוּ Ps 2:10 Infinitive absolute הַשְׂכֵּל Jer 9:23 +; הַשְׂכֵּיל ( Ges § 53 k ) Jer 3:15 ; Job 34:35 construct הַשְׂכִּיל Gen 3:6 +, etc.; Participle מַשְׂכִּיל 1Sam 18:14 +, feminine מַשְׂכָּ֑לֶת Prov 19:14 plural מַשְׂכִּילִים Dan 11:35 +, etc.; meanings hard to classify: scholars differ greatly; — 1. look at: נְחְמָד הָעֵץ לְהַשְׂכִּיל Gen 3:6 ( J ) was desirable to look upon (so ᵐ5 Ges De ; AV , RV to make one wise ; Ew Di Buhl SS Dr and others below 3 ). 2. give attention to, consider, ponder: Isa 41:20 ; Isa 44:18 ; Deut 32:29 ; Ps 64:10 ; Ps 106:7 ; Job 34:27 with לְ Prov 21:12 with אֶל Ps 41:2 ; Neh 8:13 with עַל Prov 16:20 with ב Ps 101:2 ; Dan 9:13 . 3. have insight, comprehension: Jer 9:23 (|| ׳ יָדַע י ), Ps 94:8 (|| בִּין ), Ps 119:99 , Dan 1:4 ; Dan 9:25 (|| יָדַע ); הַשְׂכֵּ(י)ל assubstantive = insight, understanding: as ׳ י 's gift to ruler and teacher, || דֵּעָה Jer 3:15 || דַּ֫עַת Job 34:35 || מַדָּע Dan 1:17 מוּסַר ׳ הַשׂ Prov 1:3 ׳ דֶּרֶךְ הַשׂ Prov 21:16 . 4. cause to consider, give insight, teach: ׳ י subject, accusative of thing, 1Chr 28:19 , accusative of person Ps 32:8 ; Neh 9:20 Gabriel subject, 2 accusative Dan 9:22 לֵב חָכָם subject, accusative of thing Prov 16:23 with לְ , Prov 21:11 ׳ הַמַּשְׂכִּילִים שֵׂכֶל טוֺב לי 2Chr 30:22 (but Be Ke Benz etc. who shewed good skill , that is, in music, v 2Chr 30:21 b); (הַ)מַוְכִּילִים Dan 11:33 ; Dan 11:35 ; Dan 12:3 ; Dan 12:10 the teachers (so Ew Hi Bev ; Thes Ke Behrm and others the wise ). 5. act circumspectly, prudently: absolute Amos 5:13 ; Ps 2:10 ; Ps 36:4 מַשְׂכִּיל as substantive Ps 14:2 = Ps 53:3 , Prov 10:5 ; Prov 10:19 ; Prov 14:35 ; Prov 15:24 ; Prov 17:2 ; Job 22:2 אִשָּׁה מַשְׂכָּ֑לֶת Prov 19:14 . — Jer 50:9 has גִּבּוֺר מַשְׁכִּיל according to Masora ( van d. H. Baer Gi ), compare ᵑ9 , i.e. a child-slaying warrior; but ׳ שׁ Hiph`il elsewhere only Hos 9:14 , of miscarriage; ᵐ5 ᵑ6 Ew and most modern ( Gf Gie Rothst ) read מַשְׂכִּיל , either skilful or fortunate. 6. prosper, have success (compare Dr 1Sam 18:5 ): absolute 1Sam 18:15 ; Isa 52:13 ; Jer 10:21 ; Jer 20:11 ; Jer 23:5 ; Josh 1:8 ( D ); with ב , v Josh 1:7 ( D ) 1Sam 18:5 ; 1Sam 18:14 (read בְּכָלֿ for לְכָלֿ Vrss Th HPS and others), compare 2Kgs 18:7 with אֶל , Prov 17:8 . 7. cause to prosper: Deut 29:8 ; 1Kgs 2:3 ( D ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8239')\">BDB8239</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7919')\">H7919</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8238')\">BDB8238</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8240')\">BDB8240</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>שָׂכַל</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be prudent</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gerber')\">Gerber<sup>47 denominative</sup></lookup> from <bdbheb>שֶׂכֶל</bdbheb>, but verb early; Late Hebrew <bdbheb>סָכַל</bdbheb>, Hithpa`el <highlight>shew oneself attentive</highlight> (to), <highlight>look</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>סְכַל</bdbarc> (rare) <highlight>understand</highlight>, Ithpa`al <highlight>look</highlight> (at), <highlight>consider</highlight>, Aph`el <highlight>instruct</highlight>; <bdbheb>שְׂכַל</bdbheb> only Aph`el (for Hebrew <bdbheb>הִשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb>), <highlight>understand, make wise</highlight>; <placeholder5265/> Pa`el <highlight>teach</highlight>, Ethpa`al <highlight>understand</highlight>, etc.; Samaritan <placeholder5266/> Ithpa`al <highlight>look</highlight> (for Hebrew <bdbheb>הִבִּיט</bdbheb>); Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>šiklu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>clever</highlight>, <transliteration><highlight>šklûtu</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>cleverness</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Meissn')\">Meissn<sup>Suppl.93</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:30\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,30)\">1Sam 18:30</ref> <highlight>be prudent, circumspect</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gerber')\">Gerber</lookup> and others <highlight>prosper.</highlight> <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,5)\">Jer 23:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 28:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,28,19)\">1Chr 28:19</ref> 1 singular <bdbheb>הִשְׂכַּלְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:99\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"99\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"99\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,99)\">Ps 119:99</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>הִשְׂכִּילוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 34:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,27)\">Job 34:27</ref> +; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,5)\">1Sam 18:5</ref> +; 2 masculine singular jussive <bdbheb>תַּשְׂכַּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 9:25\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,25)\">Dan 9:25</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine plural <bdbheb>הַשְׂכִּילוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 2:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,10)\">Ps 2:10</ref> <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>הַשְׂכֵּל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 9:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,23)\">Jer 9:23</ref> +; <bdbheb>הַשְׂכֵּיל</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges<sup> § 53 k</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Jer 3:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,15)\">Jer 3:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 34:35\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,35)\">Job 34:35</ref> <highlight>construct</highlight> <bdbheb>הַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,6)\">Gen 3:6</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,14)\">1Sam 18:14</ref> +, feminine <bdbheb>מַשְׂכָּ֑לֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 19:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,14)\">Prov 19:14</ref> plural <bdbheb>מַשְׂכִּילִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 11:35\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,35)\">Dan 11:35</ref> +, etc.; meanings hard to classify: scholars differ greatly; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>look at:</highlight> <bdbheb>נְחְמָד הָעֵץ לְהַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,6)\">Gen 3:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>was desirable to look upon</highlight> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <highlight>to make one wise</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup> and others below <b>3</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>give attention to, consider, ponder:</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 41:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,41,20)\">Isa 41:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,18)\">Isa 44:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 32:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,29)\">Deut 32:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 64:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"64\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"64\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,64,10)\">Ps 64:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 106:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,106,7)\">Ps 106:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 34:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,27)\">Job 34:27</ref> with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 21:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,12)\">Prov 21:12</ref> with <bdbheb>אֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 41:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,41,2)\">Ps 41:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:13\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,13)\">Neh 8:13</ref> with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,20)\">Prov 16:20</ref> with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 101:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,2)\">Ps 101:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:13\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,13)\">Dan 9:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>have insight, comprehension:</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 9:23\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,23)\">Jer 9:23</ref> (|| <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָדַע י</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 94:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"94\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"94\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,94,8)\">Ps 94:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בִּין</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 119:99\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"99\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"99\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,99)\">Ps 119:99</ref>, <ref ref=\"Dan 1:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,4)\">Dan 1:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:25\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,25)\">Dan 9:25</ref> (|| <bdbheb>יָדַע</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>הַשְׂכֵּ(י)ל</bdbheb> assubstantive = <highlight>insight, understanding:</highlight> as <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s gift to ruler and teacher, || <bdbheb>דֵּעָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 3:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,15)\">Jer 3:15</ref> || <bdbheb>דַּ֫עַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 34:35\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,35)\">Job 34:35</ref> || <bdbheb>מַדָּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 1:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,1,17)\">Dan 1:17</ref> <bdbheb>מוּסַר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 1:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,3)\">Prov 1:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דֶּרֶךְ הַשׂ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 21:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,16)\">Prov 21:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>cause to consider, give insight, teach:</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> subject, accusative of thing, <ref ref=\"1Chr 28:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,28,19)\">1Chr 28:19</ref>, accusative of person <ref ref=\"Ps 32:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,32,8)\">Ps 32:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 9:20\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,20)\">Neh 9:20</ref> Gabriel subject, 2 accusative <ref ref=\"Dan 9:22\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,22)\">Dan 9:22</ref> <bdbheb>לֵב חָכָם</bdbheb> subject, accusative of thing <ref ref=\"Prov 16:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,23)\">Prov 16:23</ref> with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Prov 21:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,11)\">Prov 21:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַמַּשְׂכִּילִים שֵׂכֶל טוֺב לי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:22\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,22)\">2Chr 30:22</ref> (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ke')\">Ke</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz</lookup> etc. <highlight>who shewed</highlight> good <highlight>skill</highlight>, that is, in music, v<ref ref=\"2Chr 30:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,21)\">2Chr 30:21</ref>b); <bdbheb>(הַ)מַוְכִּילִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 11:33\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,33)\">Dan 11:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 11:35\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,35)\">Dan 11:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,3)\">Dan 12:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 12:10\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,10)\">Dan 12:10</ref> <highlight>the teachers</highlight> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bev')\">Bev</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ke')\">Ke</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Behrm')\">Behrm</lookup> and others <highlight>the wise</highlight>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>act circumspectly, prudently:</highlight> absolute <ref ref=\"Amos 5:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,13)\">Amos 5:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 2:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,10)\">Ps 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 36:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,4)\">Ps 36:4</ref> <bdbheb>מַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb> as substantive <ref ref=\"Ps 14:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,14,2)\">Ps 14:2</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 53:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,53,3)\">Ps 53:3</ref>, <ref ref=\"Prov 10:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,5)\">Prov 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 10:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,19)\">Prov 10:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:35\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,35)\">Prov 14:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 15:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,24)\">Prov 15:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 17:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,2)\">Prov 17:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 22:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,2)\">Job 22:2</ref> <bdbheb>אִשָּׁה מַשְׂכָּ֑לֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 19:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,19,14)\">Prov 19:14</ref>. — <ref ref=\"Jer 50:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,9)\">Jer 50:9</ref> has <bdbheb>גִּבּוֺר מַשְׁכִּיל</bdbheb> according to Masora (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('van d.H.')\">van d. H.</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Baer')\">Baer</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Gi</lookup>), compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>, i.e. a child-slaying warrior; but <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlightword>elsewhere only</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,14)\">Hos 9:14</ref>, of miscarriage; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> and most modern (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gf')\">Gf</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Rothst')\">Rothst</lookup>) read <bdbheb>מַשְׂכִּיל</bdbheb>, either <highlight>skilful</highlight> or <highlight>fortunate.</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>prosper, have success</highlight> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup> <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,5)\">1Sam 18:5</ref></sup></lookup>): absolute <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:15\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" 